+# Vercel AI SDK static boundary
+
+`supportAgent` passes `buildRequest(prompt)` to `generateText`, so static inspection cannot verify the final request object at that boundary. The request also defines `prepareStep`, which may replace `instructions` before generation. Do not treat the canonical support instruction as proven effective at runtime from this structure alone.
